{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "d4a0c40b-f37c-4c8a-894e-15b3beae3cc8",
    "name": "CarHub API",
    "description": "Collection API CarHub untuk local/development. Login admin memakai cookie HttpOnly yang dikelola cookie jar Postman. Upload foto memakai dua tahap: minta field bertanda tangan dari API, lalu POST file multipart langsung ke Cloudinary. Aset Cloudinary bersifat publik dan tidak dihapus collection; gunakan akun development.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Public API",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://{{apiHost}}:{{apiPort}}/api/health",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": ["{{apiHost}}"],
              "port": "{{apiPort}}",
              "path": ["api", "health"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('returns HTTP 200', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('reports API health', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.eql({ status: 'ok' });",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "List cars",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://{{apiHost}}:{{apiPort}}/api/cars?page=1&pageSize=20",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": ["{{apiHost}}"],
              "port": "{{apiPort}}",
              "path": ["api", "cars"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "pageSize", "value": "20" }
              ]
            }
          },
          "description": "Mengisi collection variable carId dengan ID mobil pertama jika katalog tidak kosong.",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('returns a paginated car list', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(body.success).to.eql(true);",
                  "  pm.expect(body.data).to.be.an('array');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.pagination).to.include.all.keys('page', 'pageSize', 'totalItems', 'totalPages');",
                  "  if (body.data.length > 0) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('carId', String(body.data[0].id));",
                  "  }",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Get car detail",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://{{apiHost}}:{{apiPort}}/api/cars/{{carId}}",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": ["{{apiHost}}"],
              "port": "{{apiPort}}",
              "path": ["api", "cars", "{{carId}}"]
            }
          },
          "description": "Memakai ID pertama dari request List cars. Jika katalog kosong, respons 404 tetap diterima.",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('returns a car or a not-found response', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect([200, 404]).to.include(pm.response.code);",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    pm.expect(body.success).to.eql(true);",
                  "    pm.expect(body.data).to.have.property('id');",
                  "  } else {",
                  "    pm.expect(body.error.code).to.eql('NOT_FOUND');",
                  "  }",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Create car submission",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Origin",
                "value": "{{frontendOrigin}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"sellerName\": \"Postman Tester\",\n  \"sellerPhone\": \"+6281234567890\",\n  \"brand\": \"Toyota\",\n  \"model\": \"Avanza\",\n  \"year\": 2020,\n  \"transmission\": \"Automatic\",\n  \"fuelType\": \"Bensin\",\n  \"color\": \"Putih\",\n  \"bodyType\": \"MPV\",\n  \"mileage\": 25000,\n  \"expectedPrice\": 180000000,\n  \"location\": \"Jakarta\",\n  \"imageUrl\": \"https://images.example.test/carhub-postman-test.jpg\",\n  \"description\": \"Submission uji dari Postman; hapus atau moderasi data ini setelah pengujian.\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://{{apiHost}}:{{apiPort}}/api/submissions",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": ["{{apiHost}}"],
              "port": "{{apiPort}}",
              "path": ["api", "submissions"]
            },
            "description": "Request ini menambahkan data submission berstatus pending ke database. Gunakan hanya pada local/dev."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('creates a pending submission', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(body.success).to.eql(true);",
                  "  pm.expect(body.data.status).to.eql('pending');",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('submissionId', String(body.data.id));",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Request submission image upload URL",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Origin", "value": "{{frontendOrigin}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"contentType\": \"{{uploadContentType}}\",\n  \"size\": {{uploadFileSizeBytes}}\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://{{apiHost}}:{{apiPort}}/api/uploads/submissions",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": ["{{apiHost}}"],
              "port": "{{apiPort}}",
              "path": ["api", "uploads", "submissions"]
            }
          },
          "description": "Tahap 1: minta URL dan field signed upload. Atur uploadContentType dan uploadFileSizeBytes sesuai file. Ukuran dikirim oleh klien dan bukan batas keras provider. Gunakan hanya environment local/development.",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('returns signed upload URL and fields', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(body.success).to.eql(true);",
                  "  pm.expect(body.data.uploadUrl).to.be.a('string');",
                  "  pm.environment.set('submissionUploadUrl', body.data.uploadUrl);",
                  "  Object.entries(body.data.uploadFields).forEach(([key, value]) => {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('submissionUpload_' + key, String(value));",
                  "  });",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Upload submission image to Cloudinary",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "file", "type": "file", "src": null },
                { "key": "api_key", "value": "{{submissionUpload_api_key}}", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "asset_folder", "value": "{{submissionUpload_asset_folder}}", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "allowed_formats", "value": "{{submissionUpload_allowed_formats}}", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "overwrite", "value": "{{submissionUpload_overwrite}}", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "public_id", "value": "{{submissionUpload_public_id}}", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "signature", "value": "{{submissionUpload_signature}}", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "timestamp", "value": "{{submissionUpload_timestamp}}", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "upload_preset", "value": "{{submissionUpload_upload_preset}}", "type": "text" }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{submissionUploadUrl}}"
          },
          "description": "Tahap 2: pada Body > form-data, pilih file yang sama dengan request tahap 1. Upload dikirim langsung ke Cloudinary. File yang berhasil diunggah bersifat publik dan collection tidak menghapusnya. Gunakan akun local/development.",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('uploads image to Cloudinary', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(body.secure_url).to.be.a('string');",
                  "  pm.environment.set('submissionImageUrl', body.secure_url);",
                  "});",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  pm.environment.unset('submissionUploadUrl');",
                  "  ['api_key', 'asset_folder', 'allowed_formats', 'overwrite', 'public_id', 'signature', 'timestamp', 'upload_preset'].forEach((key) => {",
                  "    pm.environment.unset('submissionUpload_' + key);",
                  "  });",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
